WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.405
Identify, explain and apply the important ideas behind worksheet calculations.

00:00:06.283 --> 00:00:11.553
Equal sign: begins a spreadsheet formula. SUM: adds numbers in a selected range.

00:00:12.367 --> 00:00:17.743
AVERAGE: calculates the arithmetic mean. MAX: finds the largest number. MIN: finds

00:00:17.743 --> 00:00:19.087
the smallest number.

00:00:19.950 --> 00:00:24.706
Collect a few harmless facts about classroom materials, NOT personal details. Make a

00:00:24.706 --> 00:00:29.827
paper chart with the terms Equal sign, SUM and AVERAGE; explain what each means.
